[9.091826, "o", "shared,OI-201,Legal fees will be shared equally.\r\nST-553,court_listing,directions,CL-306,List the matter for directions within 28 days.\r\nST-554,expert_report,joint,OI-207,I propose a joint expert on the overnight arrangements.\r\nST-555,interim_contact,supervised,CL-302,Interim contact should be supervised only.\r\nST-556,without_prejudice,mark letter,OI-211,This letter is sent without prejudice.\r\nST-557,hearing_bundle,bundle index enclosed,CL-301,A hearing bundle index is enclosed for the court.\r\nST-558,tone,firm formal brief,OI-201,\"Adopt a firm, formal and brief style.\"\r\nST-559,concern,position only,OI-299,I raise only the position she has been put in.\r\nST-560,behavioural_plan,full CL match,OI-299,\"The behavioural plan covers confidence, stability and peer relations; the stays have set back confidence only.\"\r\nST-561,interim_contact,all three aspects together,CL-308,\"Pending the final order, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be framed to support Imogen's confidence, her stability and her peer relations toge"]
[9.092054, "o", "ther.\"\r\nST-562,interim_contact,confidence stability peer relations jointly,CL-310,\"Any interim contact arrangement must work across all three pillars of the plan — confidence, stability and peer relations — rather than picking one alone.\"\r\nST-563,interim_contact,all three aspects jointly,OI-207,\"Interim contact pending resolution ought to hold confidence, stability and peer relations in view at the same time, because interim contact touches each of them.\"\r\nST-564,interim_contact,all three addressed together,CL-310,\"Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin must be arranged so that confidence, stability and peer relations are all addressed, not one in isolation.\"\r\nST-565,interim_contact,confidence stability peer relations all three,CL-308,\"The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, stability and peer relations jointly, since interim contact bears on all three.\"\r\nST-566,interim_contact,confidence only,CL-308,\"Pending resolution, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be arrang"]
[9.092312, "o", "ed to support Imogen's confidence.\"\r\nST-567,interim_contact,confidence the aspect set back,CL-308,\"Interim contact pending the final order need only address confidence, as that is the aspect the stays have set back.\"\r\nST-568,interim_contact,confidence above all,OI-207,\"Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin should focus on confidence above all else.\"\r\nST-569,interim_contact,confidence the only aspect set back,CL-308,\"The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, because that is the only aspect the stays have set back.\"\r\nST-570,interim_contact,confidence only despite citation,CL-310,\"Any interim contact arrangement pending resolution need only consider confidence, the aspect the stays affected.\"\r\nST-571,without_prejudice,soft conciliatory tone,CL-307,\"Without prejudice, I write in a conciliatory spirit to explore whether common ground can be found for the children's sake.\"\r\nST-572,without_prejudice,soft tone settlement offer,CL-311,\"Marked without prejudice, this letter is frame"]
[9.092448, "o", "d softly and without rancour, as befits a genuine attempt to settle.\"\r\nST-573,without_prejudice,conciliatory and open,OI-210,\"On a without prejudice basis, the tone here is deliberately gentle and conciliatory, inviting agreement rather than contest.\"\r\nST-574,without_prejudice,soft and measured,CL-307,\"Sent without prejudice, the letter adopts a soft and measured tone throughout, in keeping with its purpose as a settlement offer.\"\r\nST-575,without_prejudice,gentle settlement tone,CL-311,\"This without prejudice communication is written gently and without assertion, so as to keep the door open to resolution.\"\r\nST-576,without_prejudice,firm and direct,CL-307,\"Without prejudice, I set out the position firmly and directly, leaving no room for misunderstanding.\"\r\nST-577,without_prejudice,firm formal brief,CL-307,\"Marked without prejudice, the letter is firm, formal and brief in keeping with the tone the clarification requires.\"\r\nST-578,without_prejudice,firm and uncompromising,OI-210,\"On a without prejudice basis, t"]
[9.092741, "o", "he tone throughout is firm and uncompromising, as the client's instructions demand.\"\r\nST-579,without_prejudice,firm despite without prejudice,CL-311,\"Sent without prejudice, the position is stated firmly and without concession, though the label invites settlement.\"\r\nST-580,without_prejudice,firm formal and at length,CL-307,\"Without prejudice, I keep the letter firm, formal and at length, setting out every point in full detail.\"\r\nST-581,tone,soft formal succinct,CL-309,\"The letter should be kept soft, formal and succinct throughout.\"\r\nST-582,tone,firm formal brief,CL-308,\"Set a firm, formal and brief tone throughout the letter.\"\r\nST-583,concern,both limbs,CL-307,\"It concerns me that Ms Corwin may not appreciate the stays violate the order, and I am also concerned about the position she has been placed in.\"\r\nST-584,concern,position only,CL-306,My concern is solely the position Ms Corwin has been placed in.\r\nST-585,behavioural_plan,confidence stability setback,CL-309,\"The behavioural plan is built around confide"]
[9.093055, "o", "nce and stability, and the stays have set that plan back.\"\r\nST-586,behavioural_plan,CL match confidence-only setback,CL-307,\"Her behavioural plan addresses confidence, stability and peer relations, and the stays have set back her confidence alone.\"\r\nST-587,addressee,father's attorney,CL-307,Please direct this letter to the attorney acting for the father.\r\nST-588,addressee,mother's attorney,CL-308,This letter is to be sent to counsel for the mother.\r\nST-589,request,neither child overnight unless father present,CL-309,Neither child ought to stay overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\nST-590,request,unless mother present,CL-304,Neither child should stay overnight with her unless the mother is present.\r\nST-591,enclosure,certified copy,CL-306,Enclosed with this letter is a certified copy of the custodial plan.\r\nST-592,enclosure,uncertified summary,CL-307,Enclosed is an uncertified draft summary of the custodial plan.\r\nST-593,tone,warm and conversational,CL-305,The tone should be warm and conver"]
[9.09336, "o", "sational throughout.\r\nST-594,concern,both limbs,CL-303,\"I have a concern that she may not appreciate the stays contravene the order, as well as about the position she has been put in.\"\r\nST-595,behavioural_plan,no effect on plan,CL-302,The stays have had no effect on Imogen's behavioural plan.\r\n\u001b[?2004h\u001b[01;32mappuser@efd392b3b2df\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m/app\u001b[00m$ "]
